918
01:22:06,004 --> 01:22:07,104
Ah, porra.

919
01:22:07,106 --> 01:22:08,405
Bem aqui.

920
01:22:08,407 --> 01:22:10,674
Parece que o alternador pegou fogo,

921
01:22:10,676 --> 01:22:12,042
