925
01:22:20,319 --> 01:22:21,418
Oi Foster.

926
01:22:21,420 --> 01:22:22,686
Ei, é Cody.

927
01:22:22,688 --> 01:22:26,289
Sim, estou aqui preso com o cara de,

928
01:22:26,291 --> 01:22:29,386
